{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/a_t10_i01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/a_t10_i01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_01",
      "hash64": "6DEE340AD5E42AF7",
      "text": "公民馆是这个地方的人们\\n聚在一起学习交流，\\r\\n还有休息的地方哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_02",
      "hash64": "6DEE350AD5E42CAA",
      "text": "你去过庆典了吗？\\n庆典还会持续一段时间，好好享受吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_03",
      "hash64": "6DEE360AD5E42E5D",
      "text": "我听见宝伴广场那边传来了\\n很响的声音……\\r\\n但我们并没有计划放什么烟花呀。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_03_04",
      "hash64": "6DEE2F0AD5E42278",
      "text": "真没想到尊贵的厄诡椪\\n竟然会那么可爱！\\c\\n……要不要和管理员商量一下，\\n做些厄诡椪的周边产品呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_01",
      "hash64": "9DE024348DAB6DFC",
      "text": "帕底亚地区有个很大的学校，对吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_02",
      "hash64": "9DE027348DAB7315",
      "text": "说到庆典，就会想到刨冰！\\c\\n我推荐蓝色阿罗拉口味哦。\\n……舌头也会变蓝就是了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_03",
      "hash64": "9DE026348DAB7162",
      "text": "总觉得外边闹哄哄的，\\n难不成是宝伴复活了？\\r\\n……才怪啦～开个玩笑，呵呵呵！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_t10_i01_npc_04_04",
      "hash64": "9DE021348DAB68E3",
      "text": "你见到厄诡椪了！？\\c\\n我猜明年的庆典啊，\\n鬼面具一定会大受欢迎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
